266	    /**
267	     * Whether any existing owner has the given derived identity key. This is the single basis for
268	     * duplicate detection: a create is rejected only when the whole key matches an existing owner
269	     * exactly. See {@link Owner#getIdentityKey()} for the key's definition.
270	     */
